OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome evening
OL,6,Fsunny spells and then clear spells at
OL,7,Ffirst overnight. Gradually clouding
OL,8,Fover from the east with patchy rain
OL,9,Fspreading from the west later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FCloud and outbreaks of rain
OL,12,Fsoon spreading northeast through the
OL,13,Fmorning. Becoming dry but a bit breezy
OL,14,Fthrough the afternoon with some
OL,15,Fbrighter spells developing. Feeling
OL,16,Fwarm in any sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
