OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FPatchy
OL,6,Frain on Wednesday morning, turning
OL,7,Fdrier in the afternoon. Bright spells
OL,8,Fand scattered showers on Thursday and
OL,9,FFriday.
